# VERBATIM data block data_sar330 from CCDC deposition 2195123 (CCDC Access Structures, downloaded by the user), cited in 10.1021/acs.inorgchem.4c00351 CCDC 2195123
# Crystal of K3[Ni]3- (CCDC 2195123, K3[Ni1]); the row's model replaces one Ni by Zn and reduces the tmsab bridge, and the SI says the [Ni]3- X-ray structure was used directly and the single-Ni model followed 'the same computational strategy', i.e. computed on this crystal geometry with the substitution.; crystal formula C62 H106 K3 N8 Ni2 O34 S8. Experimental (X-ray) structure, not optimised. Embedded reflection data omitted.
